---
import Section from '@csss-site-events/ui/components/Section.astro';
import { Mail } from '@lucide/astro';
import Button from '@csss-site-events/ui/components/buttons/Button.astro';
---

<Section id="sponsors" title="Sponsors">
  Every Frosh Week takes months of planning and wouldn't be possible without the CSSS executives and
  volunteers. There is one last piece to making Frosh a success: sponsors.
  <br /><br />

  If you're interested in sponsoring this event, please email csss-froshchair@sfu.ca.
  <Fragment slot="footer">
    <Button href="mailto:csss-froshchair@sfu.ca" size="lg"><Mail />Frosh Chair</Button>
  </Fragment>
</Section>
